  "description": "Side Step | Nerf Bar | Running Boards Replacement for 2019-2026 Dodge Ram 1500 New Body Crew Cab (NOT for Classic)\nOEDRO running boards make it easier and safer to enter and exit your vehicle. When you’re tired, climbing into a truck feels like climbing a mountain. Boards also help prevent paint scratches on the side of your car. They protect your vehicle from the debris that gets kicked up when driving on rough terrain.\nFeatures\n6-inch side pedals. The two-level layout provides better convenience for vehicles equipped with lifting kits and oversized tires.\nThree-tube design. The three-tube design provides more protection for the bottom and sides of the vehicle while preventing it from getting stuck on the rocker or hanging obstacles.\nBolt-fixed installation. Welded brackets provide extra strength without cutting or drilling.\nstrong and sturdy. The unique powder coating has anti-rust and corrosion resistance, so it can be driven under any conditions.\nlaser cutting. The tread step surface is enhanced and anti-skid and grip.\n1-year warranty. For your safety, professional installation is recommended\nFitment\nCompatible with 2019-2026 Dodge Ram 1500 New Body Crew Cab\nNot For Classic Models",
